  lore:
  - id: dead-drop/0
    title: Before the freeze
    company: MORROW FINANCIAL
    contract: Dead Drop
    text: 'MORROW / PRIORITY ORDER: Freeze the account at 06:00, before the hearing. The attached risk assessment contains no financial analysis; it lists the whistleblower''s recent contacts instead.'
  - id: dead-drop/1
    title: Mirror instructions
    company: MORROW FINANCIAL
    contract: Dead Drop
    text: 'Mirror operator''s instructions: Confirm the replacement order in both stores. If the signatures agree, the automated review accepts the correction before the next batch. Do not leave a contradictory copy.'
  - id: dead-drop/2
    title: The name on the list
    company: MORROW FINANCIAL
    contract: Dead Drop
    text: 'The whistleblower''s last draft: They have a list of everyone who asked questions. I thought leaving the company would get me off it. Now I know why the surveillance contract was worth more than the bank.'
